{"cast":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8hsgdTRHNccwszb84vCBGGck5yq.jpg","genre_ids":[99,10770],"id":150392,"title":"The Men Who Made the Movies: Howard Hawks","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Men Who Made the Movies: Howard Hawks","overview":"","popularity":0.7805,"poster_path":"/sWOFvfIHmEg6puVFo5kWRjl9gye.jpg","release_date":"1973-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.818,"vote_count":11,"character":"Self","credit_id":"52fe4ae19251416c910c8c39","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":920898,"title":"Howard Hawks: Reporter's Notebook","original_language":"en","original_title":"Howard Hawks: Reporter's Notebook","overview":"","popularity":0.3512,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"1999-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self (Archive Footage)","credit_id":"623a9dd2c74eba0047cd0379","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":952953,"title":"Hawks on Hawks","original_language":"en","original_title":"Hawks on Hawks","overview":"","popularity":0.3668,"poster_path":"/5zOzm3OFSDIpJblimspEJy7nI4P.jpg","release_date":"2017-01-10","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"623abb9e211ce5005c94c1e0","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/1sS6ilJQOv6QUbQ6cgZ0E7mh5qB.jpg","genre_ids":[35,878],"id":24008,"title":"Małpia kuracja","original_language":"en","original_title":"Monkey Business","overview":"Doktor Barnaby Fulton, pracownik koncernu chemicznego, od lat usiłuje wynaleźć eliksir młodości. Kolejne specyfiki stosuje bez powodzenia na szympansach. Jego szef Olivier Oxley jest coraz bardziej zniecierpliwiony brakiem efektów i stratą pochłoniętych przez badania pieniędzy. Pewnego dnia, podczas nieobecności Fultona w laboratorium, wydostaje się z klatki jedna z małp i na chybił trafił miesza rozmaite mikstury. Gdy doktor wraca, przypadkowo wypija przygotowany przez szympansa płyn...","popularity":2.1954,"poster_path":"/ptRXD0l2R6HL7mqcFLFrGQZq3ZR.jpg","release_date":"1952-09-03","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.7,"vote_count":298,"character":"Narrator (voice) (uncredited)","credit_id":"64ee6c3177d23b00aebe1462","order":28},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":983284,"title":"Hedda Hopper's Hollywood No. 3","original_language":"en","original_title":"Hedda Hopper's Hollywood No. 3","overview":"","popularity":0.4665,"poster_path":"/ehBsAbfiHu1KqQifpuVWWAGGZdh.jpg","release_date":"1942-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":10.0,"vote_count":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"62997dfb8fdda9005183eee0","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ry2ahGMYUf0MDbBVQd2uDMakFPI.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":698004,"title":"Commemoration: Howard Hawks' 'Rio Bravo'","original_language":"en","original_title":"Commemoration: Howard Hawks' 'Rio Bravo'","overview":"","popularity":0.8921,"poster_path":"/A7ThZSlGW8fTGqhoMfLTbBU4bs.jpg","release_date":"2007-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"62f12555880c9200828edcc6","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/eb0e4sQN7olryRx8v3NVbHIH41w.jpg","genre_ids":[28,18],"id":80046,"title":"Red Line 7000","original_language":"en","original_title":"Red Line 7000","overview":"","popularity":1.2701,"poster_path":"/lw3nxKQsRfPUMd6rE6Ch4h51e0D.jpg","release_date":"1965-11-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.444,"vote_count":36,"character":"Driver (uncredited)","credit_id":"6332f2657d2bc1007da2e36b","order":22},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/bIv1kaxb7tsiZYPO27PHfVb5eSF.jpg","genre_ids":[80,28,18,53],"id":877,"title":"Człowiek z blizną","original_language":"en","original_title":"Scarface","overview":"Młody przestępca zabiega o to, by zająć pozycję szefa gangu. Gdy osiąga swój cel, rozprawia się z przeciwnikami w wyjątkowo brutalny sposób.","popularity":3.872,"poste